    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκρι-ωτήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>upright</i> supporting a gallery or loft, <i><span class="en">
