				22.1668.78
			</span></i>: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.313.110
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκ-</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῆρες, οἱ</span>, <i>flooring of the
